# Paths script/oss/export-public.sh leaves out of the public tree. One path or
# glob per line, relative to the repo root. Owner-only material should not be
# committed at all (see .gitignore); this list is the second line of defence
# for anything still tracked or committed by mistake.
plans/
.claude/
.twincurrent-build/
.build-logs/
HANDOVER.md
wireframes/
.mcp.json
CLAUDE.local.md
.env*
